stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> QUEUED
    QUEUED --> SPECIALISTS_RUNNING
    SPECIALISTS_RUNNING --> BRIEFS_SUBMITTED
    BRIEFS_SUBMITTED --> SUPERVISING

    SUPERVISING --> RISK_MAPPING: 证据覆盖足够
    RISK_MAPPING --> USER_REVIEW

    SUPERVISING --> DEGRADED: 单一来源超时 / 数据过期
    DEGRADED --> USER_REVIEW: 等待核验报告

    SUPERVISING --> QUARANTINED: 证据冲突 / 未证实传闻
    QUARANTINED --> VERIFICATION_ONLY
    VERIFICATION_ONLY --> USER_REVIEW

    USER_REVIEW --> REVIEWED: 用户标记已阅读
    REVIEWED --> [*]

    note right of USER_REVIEW
      human_gate = REQUIRED
      no broker
      no automatic trade
    end note

